- [Pair interactions](#pair-interactions)
- [A teaching example: combat rules](#a-teaching-example-combat-rules)
- [Presentation and the complete application loop](#presentation-and-the-complete-application-loop)
- [Input, prediction and rollback](#input-prediction-and-rollback)
- [Effects and external actions](#effects-and-external-actions)
